Explanation:
The crash was caused by misuse of the API, specifically calling `sqlite3_close` before `sqlite3_finalize` can result in a crash.

Test Case:
Ensure you call `sqlite3_finalize` before `sqlite3_close`.

How to ensure API conformity:
Always ensure that you call `sqlite3_finalize` before `sqlite3_close`.

API Good:
sqlite3* db;
sqlite3_open16(dbFilename, &db);
sqlite3_finalize(db);
sqlite3_close(db);

API Bad:
sqlite3* db;
sqlite3_open16(dbFilename, &db);
sqlite3_close(db);
sqlite3_finalize(db); // Crash